WEBVTT

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:15.460
Listen, Souta.

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:16.620
Yeah?

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.720
About Poco-chan...

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:22.700
You said you're gonna live with him. 
Were you serious about that?

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:23.830
Why do you ask?

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:25.500
Why do I...

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.930
He's your friend's child, isn't he?

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:30.450
You can't stay together forever.

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.500
Isn't it about time you thought about that?

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:37.310
You've gotta talk it over with Poco-chan, too.

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:42.140
<i>Sis was right.</i>

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:46.550
<i>I need to man up and really think this through,</i>

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:49.830
<i>so I can be together with Poco forever.</i>

